# Experiment Management

## Results Directory
All experiments stored in [experiments/](mdc:experiments/) with organized subdirectories

## Experiment Structure
- **PKU Experiments**: [experiments/pku/](mdc:experiments/pku/)
  - intent/ - Intent-only experiments
  - sal/ - Saliency-only experiments  
  - sal+intent/ - Combined guidance experiments
- **CGL Experiments**: [experiments/cgl/](mdc:experiments/cgl/)
  - Similar structure to PKU experiments

## Experiment Naming
- Format: `MM_DD_HHMM_<experiment_type>/`
- Types: uncond, c, cwh, complete
- Timestamps for easy identification

## Checkpoint Management
- **Base Directory**: [data/checkpoints/](mdc:data/checkpoints/)
- **Model Weights**: [data/model_weights/](mdc:data/model_weights/)
- **Intent Models**: [data/model_weights/intent_map/](mdc:data/model_weights/intent_map/)

## Output Files
- **Generated Layouts**: Saved as images in experiment directories
- **Metrics**: Computed using [code/utils/metric.py](mdc:code/utils/metric.py)
- **Visualizations**: Generated by [code/utils/visualize.py](mdc:code/utils/visualize.py)
- **Logs**: Training and evaluation logs

## Experiment Tracking
- Use consistent naming conventions
- Document hyperparameters in experiment directories
- Save model checkpoints regularly
- Track metrics and visualizations